        <falsepenalty/>
        <falsenextnode>-1</falsenextnode>
        <falseanswernote>prt1-1-F</falseanswernote>
        <falsefeedback format="html">
          <text><![CDATA[<p>{@simp:false@}</p><p>Here, we can test values but in order to get the exact answer we need to carry out a process similar to rationalising a fraction with roots and simplifying to avoid the indetermination\(\frac{0}{0}\).</p><p>\(\displaystyle f(x) = {@fx@} = {@fx@}\cdot \frac{{@numer2@}}{{@numer2@}} = \frac{(x+1) - {@aa@}^2}{({@denom@})\cdot ({@numer2@})} \)</p><p>\(\displaystyle = \frac{{@ev(x+1-aa^2,simp)@}}{({@denom@})\cdot ({@numer2@})} = \frac{1}{{@numer2@}}\), which can be evaluated at \(x={@lim@}\), removing the indetermination.</p><p>Therefore, the limit is \(\displaystyle \frac{1}{\sqrt{{@aa^2-1@}}} = {@ta@}\)</p>]]></text>
        </falsefeedback>
